
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>HD Healthcare System</title>
</head>

<body style="margin:0; padding:0; background-color:#f3f4f6; font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif; color:#1f2937;">

  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"
    style="background-color:#f3f4f6; padding:32px 12px;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">

        <!-- Main Container -->
        <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"
          style="max-width:560px; background-color:#ffffff; border-radius:16px; overflow:hidden;">

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center"
              style="background-color:#111827; padding:30px 24px;">

              <h1 style="margin:0; color:#ffffff; font-size:28px; letter-spacing:-0.5px;">
                Hello Doctor
              </h1>

              <p style="margin:10px 0 0; color:#d1d5db; font-size:14px; line-height:22px;">
                Your health journey starts here
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Email Content -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:32px 28px 24px;">

              <p style="margin:0 0 18px; font-size:16px; line-height:25px;">
                Hello <strong><%= userName %></strong>,
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 18px; color:#4b5563; font-size:14px; line-height:24px;">
                Welcome to <strong style="color:#111827;">HD Health Care System</strong>
                We're delighted to have you join our community.
                Thank you for creating an account with us.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:0 0 24px; color:#4b5563; font-size:14px; line-height:24px;">
                We've designed Hello Doctor to help make your healthcare experience
                simpler and more convenient. Whether you're looking to manage your
                healthcare needs or stay connected with medical services, we're here
                to help you along the way.
              </p>

              <!-- Welcome Message -->
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"
                style="background-color:#f9fafb; border:1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius:12px;">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="padding:24px 20px;">

                    <div style="display:inline-block; width:48px; height:48px; line-height:48px; border-radius:50%; background-color:#dbeafe; color:#1d4ed8; font-size:26px; font-weight:bold;">
                      &#10003;
                    </div>

                    <h2 style="margin:16px 0 8px; color:#111827; font-size:20px;">
                      You're All Set!
                    </h2>

                    <p style="margin:0; color:#6b7280; font-size:14px; line-height:23px;">
                      Your registration is complete, and your Hello Doctor account
                      is ready to use.
                    </p>

                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="margin:24px 0 16px; color:#4b5563; font-size:14px; line-height:23px;">
                Here are a few friendly reminders to help you get started:
              </p>

              <!-- Helpful Tips -->
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
                <tr>
                  <td width="24" valign="top"
                    style="padding:0 0 12px; color:#2563eb; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold;">
                    &#10003;
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:0 0 12px; color:#4b5563; font-size:14px; line-height:22px;">
                    Keep your account information accurate and up to date.
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td width="24" valign="top"
                    style="padding:0 0 12px; color:#2563eb; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold;">
                    &#10003;
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:0 0 12px; color:#4b5563; font-size:14px; line-height:22px;">
                    Protect your account credentials and never share your password.
                  </td>
                </tr>

                <tr>
                  <td width="24" valign="top"
                    style="padding:0 0 12px; color:#2563eb; font-size:16px; font-weight:bold;">
                    &#10003;
                  </td>
                  <td style="padding:0 0 12px; color:#4b5563; font-size:14px; line-height:22px;">
                    Contact our support team if you need assistance with your account.
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Closing -->
              <p style="margin:20px 0 0; color:#4b5563; font-size:14px; line-height:23px;">
                We're excited to be part of your healthcare journey and look forward
                to providing you with a helpful experience.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:24px 0 0; color:#4b5563; font-size:14px; line-height:23px;">
                Warm regards,<br />
                <strong style="color:#111827;">The HD Team</strong>
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td align="center"
              style="padding:20px 24px; background-color:#f9fafb; border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;">

              <p style="margin:0; color:#9ca3af; font-size:12px; line-height:20px;">
                This is an automated welcome email. Please do not reply to this message.
              </p>

              <p style="margin:8px 0 0; color:#9ca3af; font-size:11px;">
                &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Hello-Doctor. All rights reserved.
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>

      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>
